<title>ARGENTINA: Acindar 9-mth net $20.4 mln vs $29.6 mln loss.</title>
<headline>Acindar 9-mth net $20.4 mln vs $29.6 mln loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31. Net $20.4 million vs $29.6 million loss. Revs $433 million vs $420 million. </p>
<p>NOTE: the company provided nor results for the third quarter nor EPS.</p>
